        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/coastaltown/_scene_copperhead.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 433b16bc-f9d5-4c6c-ae7a-3619c12d8743).Image",
        "Description": "Hey bud, it&apos;s me again. I&apos;ve found us another job.\r\rWhen you took down the Either Bio-lab under the Caruso mansion, they shut down the whole area and tore the mansion down. Now, a movie set is being moved on site, with two of my agents stationed there to eliminate the town mayor. These two are high ranking agents, and killing them will leave big mark on my organizaion. I&apos;ve planned the whole thing out, so you shold not have a hard time. By the way, the name of my organization is the Ark Society.",
